{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111190","id":2883831812,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6r48gE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111190","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111190.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111190.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111190","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111190/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111190/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111190/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/01b92088508b1a59099f72dd97c0d40f9dc137f8","number":111190,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix LineEdit Unicode code-point/control character insertion failing to emit `text_changed`","user":{"login":"SantiagoDaza3","id":127449345,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5i5AQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127449345?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3","html_url":"https://github.com/SantiagoDaza3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SantiagoDaza3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\r\n`LineEdit` did not emit `text_changed` when text was inserted via Unicode code-point input and the “Insert Control Character” menu. This would break UI logic that depends on `text_changed`.\r\n\r\n### Reproduction\r\nMinimal scene with a single `LineEdit` element and the following attached script:\r\n\r\n```Python\r\nextends LineEdit\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n    text_changed.connect(func(new_text):\r\n        print(\"text_changed:\", new_text))\r\n```\r\n\r\nPressing ctrl + shift + u and typing `2020` then pressing enter inserts the dagger character (†) but does not trigger `text_changed` i.e. no print statement is written to the console.\r\n\r\nRight click + Insert Control Character (pick any) also inserts but does **not** trigger `text_changed`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b3ac2a4-2b5b-4b6c-adad-1ac9fc9d4ea1\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\nAfter performing the two aforementioned insertions, defer `_text_changed()` and set the `text_changed_dirty` guard (exact same process used in `paste_text()` ). Regular typing and paste behavior remains unaffected. `set_text()` is unchanged and still does **not** emit, as per the documentation. This is a small, localized fix in `scene/gui/line_edit.cpp`\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d11362b-e9e6-4047-97b9-8e55f7624c5b\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\nVerified fix on a Windows dev build, code-point submission and control character insertion now print once to the console and update any bound UI elements. Regular typing, paste, and deletions have been verified to still emit exactly once.\r\n\r\nFormatting: clang-format 17\r\n\r\nFixes #110809\r\n\r\nNote: There is an overlapping PR #110988 that instead moves the `text_changed` emission logic to the core function `insert_text_at_caret()` while removing `text.length() != prev_len` checks to determine whether to emit `text_changed` or not. Let me know if this more general change to a core function is preferred, as the changes in my PR attempt to fix two specific bugs without altering core functions while aligning with the existing architecture. A previous PR #84382 also attempted to alter `insert_text_at_caret()` directly which resulted in duplicate signals.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gist